        f"A library-preserving null is a different test, and XDS-M failed it ({f0(D('LM','XDSM')['mean_calls'])} calls per run in monocytes, {f0(D('FC','XDSM')['mean_calls'])} in pDCs; pseudobulk {f0(D('LM','PB')['mean_calls'])} and {f0(D('FC','PB')['mean_calls'])}), as did our library-split variant in monocytes; "
