W(f"- The pre-stated expectation that pseudobulk fails more in the few-cell type (A-d) is not supported: its per-pair type-I is {f3(A('LM','PB')['mean_t05'])} at about 1,000 cells per donor and {f3(A('FC','PB')['mean_t05'])} at 15 cells per donor. Pseudobulk fails at both extremes of cell number in this cohort.")
W(f"- SLE-label null (B): XDS-Mgu holds in both cell types (0 false calls in 20 runs each); pseudobulk differential co-expression fails ({f0(B('LM','PBDC')['mean_calls'])} and {f0(B('FC','PBDC')['mean_calls'])} false calls per run, {S['LM']['B']['rho_PB']*100:.0f}% and {S['FC']['B']['rho_PB']*100:.0f}% of the real PB-DC call counts; rule B-c, 'not interpretable' at >= 50%, is not triggered).")
