W("- Data scope: none reduced. All cells of both cell types and all donors with >= 4 cells were used (LM 307,429 cells / 261 donors; FC 5,181 / 235). All analyses have the planned 20 reassignments (A, A2, B, D) and the real-donor runs. No analysis was cut.")
W("- Declared adaptations (in Plan 7 before any run): exact streaming cps (the OneK1K run used a 5,000-cell subsample); forced-gene list with ISG genes in place of the PVM markers; XDS-Mlib assigns each donor's 4-16 libraries to halves by coin flips (Plan 6 used donors with exactly two libraries); the extra size check A2 and the D3 differential co-expression part were added to the plan before running.")
W("- Plan 6 analyses not run here and not part of Plan 7: planted covariance, depth-matched null, planted confounder, sex diagnostics.")
W("- Smoke tests (seeds +999, scratch directory) were run on the real panels to check the code; their outputs were not used. One smoke run of the library-preserving mode showed XDS-M with many calls before the real runs; no rule or code was changed in response. The real-donor mode has no seed offset, so its smoke output equals the reported real-donor result (identical counts were confirmed on the Modal run).")
W("- In the few-cell type some genes have zero variance within a SLE or control group, which gives undefined PB-DC correlations for those pairs; such pairs are excluded from BH and counted as p >= 0.05 in the per-pair type-I of PB-DC.")
W("- Real-donor SLE-vs-control calls are confounded with processing cohort (cohort 1 has no SLE donor; cohort 2 has 106 of 162 SLE monocyte donors) and with cell number per donor (SLE median 1,132 vs 792 monocytes per donor; 12 vs 24 pDCs); they are descriptive and are not evidence of SLE-specific co-expression changes except where stated post hoc after pool adjustment.")
W("- Disclosure correction to the Plan 7 header (the plan is frozen and unchanged): before it was written, the h5ad obs columns suspension_uuid, ind_cov, ct_cov, author_cell_type, cell_state, disease, sex and observation_joinid were read in addition to the four named in the plan, and value counts of ct_cov and cell_state and a ct_cov by cell_type cross-table were printed. None of these entered a rule, a panel or an analysis; the author cell-type labels were not used (cell types are Census cell_type). No expression values of the dataset were read before the plan was frozen.")
W("- Amendment 1 and 2 results are post hoc. The two failed variants (XDS-Mpool validity, XDS-Mlibpool) have only untested explanations.")
W("- Plan 7 itself used the Modal CPU image im-vNcuP00ryKr0nZlE9sgcfw (numpy 1.26.4, scipy 1.17.1); smoke tests ran locally on numpy 2.4.6. Local code is a Plan 6 repo snapshot (artifact 14ce1518-9840-4775-a50d-3756123e6618); modules used are copied unchanged into code.tgz (hashes in input_hashes.txt).\n")
